{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42172","headline":"题画石山 · 徐铉","name":"题画石山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彼美巉岩石，谁施黼藻功。\n回岩明照地，绝壁烂临空。\n锦段鲜须濯，罗屏展易穷。\n不因秋藓绿，非假晚霞红。\n羽客藏书洞，樵人取箭风。\n灵踪理难问，仙路去何通。\n返驾归尘里，留情向此中。\n回瞻画图畔，遥羡面山翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}